    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "3fbw5yf",
      "content": "22. Feni, Goa's heritage drink, has been given which tag?"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "4qsfa6i",
      "content": "   (a) Heritage Tag   (b) GI (Geographical Indication) Tag   (c) Organic Certification   (d) UNESCO Intangible Heritage"
